  "semantics": [
    "Pooling reads signed bytes and implements native max2,max4 and average3 branches. Unsupported mode/kernel pairs preserve data and return0.",
    "Max2 preloads eight values before four stores. Its four-output unroll writes a full final group even if logical columns are not divisible by4; input/output padding is required. Cached dimensions/stride remain live local values across aliases.",
    "Average3 converts signed sums/kernel to binary32, divides, compares to0, adds signed half (negative half at zero) and performs defined RTZ conversion. The zero case intentionally retains native inexact status.",
    "Float addition performs the complete forward sum pass before reading the operation activation flag. It does not multiply by batch count. Activation1 chooses ReLU on zero slope (including FZ-flushed slope) and otherwise leaky behavior.",
    "Activation uses native carry conditions: unordered values pass through. Leaky multiplication reloads slope only on each negative ordered value, including operation/output overlaps. Signed zero, NaN operand selection and full FPSCR are preserved.",
    "The two const executor-address words point to actual C functions via normal relocations. Existing C constructors emit these pointers and C probe wrappers invoke them indirectly; no native fallback or algorithm boundary model is used.",
    "Constructor comparisons validate actual C callback identity before normalizing only the two callback-pointer record fields for measurement. The source executable maps no stock code."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Only these two callback providers are implemented here. Nine other model callback bindings and the inference/graph execution path remain unresolved. No complete neural result is claimed.",
    "The normal product is relocatable composition with80 application and22 boot imports, not a complete bootable firmware.",
    "Public RAM and full FPSCR are compared, excluding8192 private stack bytes below incoming SP. Saved R4-R11/S16-S31, SP, masks and R0 return are checked. Caller-clobbered scratch registers/APSR are not promised.",
    "Independent signed pooling oracles run under all32 FP modes; finite float-add oracles use nearest rounding. Exact native comparisons cover all32 modes.",
    "Physical sensors, concurrent tensor mutation, timing and interrupt behavior are untested. Partial max2 rows require native padding and are not silently repaired.",
    "Code hooks cover all598 body bytes, not exhaustive input/interleaving coverage. REA has no function record at the separately authenticated vector binding0x30534; raw disassembly notes are analysis-only, not an implementation."
  ],
